    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
           "text": "@Andrew Woods"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ", No, because I know Cavendish requires If-Match and does not support If-Unmodified-Since.  But the Modeshape impl. supports If-Unmodified-Since, and over in ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2478#icft=FCREPO-2478"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": " I've asked ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "5fca89892730d8007611d907",
           "text": "@Benjamin Armintor"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": " if he'd consider that for Cavendish.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Based on the discussions of this issue in the Fedora Tech call, I think If-Unmodified-Since is the best we can do since it's not really possible to reconcile strong ETags with the vagaries of RDF.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
