  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When we create placeholder resources, and then later update them with PUT, we should include the If-Unmodified-Since header to prevent accidentally overwriting any other changes that might happen in the meantime.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Note, as discussed in FCREPO-2478, the LDP spec recommends using the If-Match header.  However, the non-fixed nature of RDF makes it impractical to use strong ETags (which are required by If-Match), so If-Unmodified-Since is the alternative.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
