    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" data-account-id=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" accountid=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Andrew Woods</a>, No, because I know Cavendish requires If-Match and does not support If-Unmodified-Since.  But the Modeshape impl. supports If-Unmodified-Since, and over in \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-2478\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2478\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Use POST with a Slug header instead of PUT\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-2478\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n I've asked <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca89892730d8007611d907\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca89892730d8007611d907\" data-account-id=\"5fca89892730d8007611d907\" accountid=\"5fca89892730d8007611d907\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Benjamin Armintor</a> if he'd consider that for Cavendish.</p>\n\n<p>Based on the discussions of this issue in the Fedora Tech call, I think If-Unmodified-Since is the best we can do since it's not really possible to reconcile strong ETags with the vagaries of RDF.</p>",
