     "body": "<p>Thanks, <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" data-account-id=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" accountid=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Esmé Cowles</a></p>\n\n<p>Relevant thread: <a href=\"https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-ldpnext/2016Aug/0002.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-ldpnext/2016Aug/0002.html</a></p>",
